notes[1]:
  - created_at: "2026-08-24T09:23:52.273Z"
    author: pi-agent
    text: "[{\"body\":\"Proof at version 2026.8.23 (a non-today calendar version): without the date-from-version flag the generator heading was 2026.8.23 - 2026-08-24 (today clock date, the midnight-flip bug); with the flag it was 2026.8.23 - 2026-08-23 (the version own date, the fix). package.json was restored to 2026.8.24 afterwards and the gate re-verified green.\"}]"
    format: json
    data[1]{body}:
      "Proof at version 2026.8.23 (a non-today calendar version): without the date-from-version flag the generator heading was 2026.8.23 - 2026-08-24 (today clock date, the midnight-flip bug); with the flag it was 2026.8.23 - 2026-08-23 (the version own date, the fix). package.json was restored to 2026.8.24 afterwards and the gate re-verified green."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  package.json,project,"inserted the date-from-version flag after release-version-from-package in the changelog, changelog:full and changelog:check scripts; bumped pm-changelog to ^2026.8.17"
tests[4]{command,scope,note}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project,changelog gate passes with the derived date
  npm test,project,unit tests
  npm run coverage,project,coverage thresholds
  ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit,project,pinned binary health
close_reason: "Changelog scripts now derive the no-tag release date from the calendar version (pm-changelog ^2026.8.17). Proof at version 2026.8.23: without flag heading 2026-08-24 (clock), with flag heading 2026-08-23 (version date). Gate green at real version 2026.8.24: changelog:check ok, npm test 74/74 pass, coverage thresholds met, pinned pm health --strict-exit exit 0."
